WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.118 --> 00:00:16.887
Soon the first pack of monsters reached the woods.

2
00:00:16.888 --> 00:00:20.564
Up ahead, Ben could see Brunhilda limping.

3
00:00:20.565 --> 00:00:25.287
A minute later she ran off the course, dropping out of the race.

4
00:00:25.288 --> 00:00:30.995
"Hmm," Ben thought. That seemed suspicious, but what could he do?

5
00:00:30.996 --> 00:00:36.233
Besides, Mog had told his team to keep moving, no matter what.

6
00:00:36.234 --> 00:00:39.789
As they entered the woods, Gaby slowed down.

7
00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:42.871
She kept banging her head on the tree branches.

8
00:00:42.872 --> 00:00:47.857
"Ouch!" Then Lon, who'd had a quick start, began to tire.

9
00:00:47.858 --> 00:00:50.657
Zork and Mog quickly passed him.

10
00:00:50.658 --> 00:00:52.597
Ben zoomed through the woods.

11
00:00:52.598 --> 00:00:55.550
He was able to float right through tree branches.

12
00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:59.824
But Cleo's wrapping seemed to get snagged every few feet.

13
00:00:59.825 --> 00:01:03.222
"She's never going to catch up to me," Ben realized.

14
00:01:03.223 --> 00:01:07.539
"Now it's just Zork and Carly against me, Mog, and Deb.

15
00:01:07.540 --> 00:01:10.236
Team Black can totally win this race!"

16
00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:15.598
The two doppelgangers were running right behind Ben, both looking winded.

17
00:01:15.599 --> 00:01:19.449
Abruptly Mog halted, clutching his leg.

18
00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.133
"I pulled a muscle. Catch Zork, Ben!"

19
00:01:23.134 --> 00:01:26.996
"I will!" Ben shot forward, determined to take the lead.

20
00:01:26.997 --> 00:01:31.577
By now Ben could see the clearing ahead—and the last part of the trail.

21
00:01:31.578 --> 00:01:34.018
He wasn't too far behind Zork.

22
00:01:34.019 --> 00:01:47.924
Once they were out of the woods, he could put on a last burst of speed and make it to the finish line first.

23
00:01:47.925 --> 00:01:53.238
Ben surged ahead, keeping the focus on his own pace, rather than Zork's.

24
00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:58.849
Near the finish line he could see Brunhilda, her ankle wrapped in bandages.

25
00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:04.070
Miss Bungle was rushing toward her, with Winnie and Serena racing after her.

26
00:02:04.071 --> 00:02:07.400
"Zork, look!" Ben pointed toward the witches.

27
00:02:07.401 --> 00:02:11.004
When Zork saw Brunhilda, his eyes went wide.

28
00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:14.587
"Ompf!" He tripped over his tail and pitched forward.

29
00:02:14.588 --> 00:02:17.090
Now Ben knew he could do it.

30
00:02:17.091 --> 00:02:21.697
Zooming forward, he sailed across the finish line.

31
00:02:21.698 --> 00:02:27.626
Students began cheering, and the cheerleaders waved their black pom-poms.

32
00:02:27.627 --> 00:02:31.170
"Yes!" Ben cried, collapsing on the ground.

33
00:02:31.171 --> 00:02:33.637
Mr. Gwarg spoke into a megaphone.

34
00:02:33.638 --> 00:02:39.921
"Team Black has won the cross-country event, tying the overall score.

35
00:02:39.922 --> 00:02:47.008
The next monster who crosses the finish line will win the championship for his or her team!"

36
00:02:47.009 --> 00:02:51.872
Ben lifted his head to look toward the woods.

37
00:02:51.873 --> 00:02:57.381
"Oh no!" he murmured. Carly was racing toward the finish line.

38
00:02:57.382 --> 00:03:02.641
Fans of Team Orange erupted in loud cheers as she crossed it.

39
00:03:02.642 --> 00:03:07.166
Mr. Freaky's noses wiggled with excitement.

40
00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:10.416
"Team Orange is our new Field Day champion.

41
00:03:10.417 --> 00:03:13.052
But let's cheer for both teams.

42
00:03:13.053 --> 00:03:18.824
Remember our Monster Academy motto—if you had fun, you won!"

43
00:03:18.825 --> 00:03:21.817
Ben sat up, staring at Carly.

44
00:03:21.818 --> 00:03:24.374
Something was wrong, he thought.

45
00:03:24.375 --> 00:03:28.677
Then he realized what it was—Carly wasn't wearing an orange shirt.

46
00:03:28.678 --> 00:03:30.406
Her shirt was black.

47
00:03:30.407 --> 00:03:34.718
Zork zipped over the finish line, followed by another runner.

48
00:03:34.719 --> 00:03:37.694
"That's Carly too!" Ben cried.

49
00:03:37.695 --> 00:03:44.420
The first Carly flashed a grin at Ben and quickly shifted shapes. "Deb!" he cried.

50
00:03:44.421 --> 00:03:48.569
"Carly was using kangaroo feet again," Deb explained.

51
00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:54.032
"So I decided to use my abilities too. I changed my face—"

52
00:03:54.033 --> 00:04:00.167
"Because you knew that Brunhilda would be confused and wouldn't risk sabotaging the real Carly!"

53
00:04:00.168 --> 00:04:07.142
"Yep!" Deb grinned. "It was worth a try—and it worked great."

54
00:04:07.143 --> 00:04:12.610
With help from Winnie and Serena, Team Black explained everything to the adults.

55
00:04:12.611 --> 00:04:21.773
Miss Bungle was still speaking sternly with Brunhilda, who was sobbing loudly.

56
00:04:21.774 --> 00:04:27.803
"Correction, everyone!" Mr. Freaky ran to the center of the field, flapping his arms.

57
00:04:27.804 --> 00:04:30.562
"There's been a mistake, but don't worry.

58
00:04:30.563 --> 00:04:36.780
Field Day is completely under control!

59
00:04:36.781 --> 00:04:39.679
Team Black is our winner."

60
00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:46.255
Wild cheers rang out as Team Black did a celebration dance on the field.

61
00:04:46.256 --> 00:04:50.494
When school was over for the day, Ben found Winnie at her locker.

62
00:04:50.495 --> 00:04:54.591
She smiled at him. "Congratulations again!"

63
00:04:54.592 --> 00:04:57.500
"Thanks." Ben was smiling too.

64
00:04:57.501 --> 00:05:03.065
"It feels pretty great to be a Field Day champion."

65
00:05:03.066 --> 00:05:07.901
"I heard that Brunhilda and Zork are in big trouble," Winnie said.

66
00:05:07.902 --> 00:05:11.711
"They were the only ones on Team Orange who cheated."

67
00:05:11.712 --> 00:05:16.453
"It's a good thing that you and Serena noticed something weird was going on," Ben said.

68
00:05:16.454 --> 00:05:19.685
"Speaking of weird." Winnie looked down.

69
00:05:19.686 --> 00:05:22.090
"Sorry that I've been acting strange.

70
00:05:22.091 --> 00:05:24.833
My cousin causes so much commotion.

71
00:05:24.834 --> 00:05:28.845
It's not easy being around such a beautiful witch."

72
00:05:28.846 --> 00:05:31.397
"Yes, it is!" Ben blurted out.

73
00:05:31.398 --> 00:05:33.444
Winnie looked up with a smile.

74
00:05:33.445 --> 00:05:36.805
But before she could reply, Mog came rushing up.

75
00:05:36.806 --> 00:05:42.778
"Guys! We need to say thank you to Serena for helping Team Black win Field Day.

76
00:05:42.779 --> 00:05:44.673
She's right over there."

77
00:05:44.674 --> 00:05:46.784
Ben looked down the hallway.

78
00:05:46.785 --> 00:05:53.515
As usual, Serena was surrounded by lots of monsters, all trying desperately to impress her.

79
00:05:53.516 --> 00:05:57.287
"I doubt we'll be able to get her attention right now, Mog."

80
00:05:57.288 --> 00:06:00.941
"We're the new Field Day champions," Mog said.

81
00:06:00.942 --> 00:06:05.528
"So everybody should be paying attention to us, not her!"

82
00:06:05.529 --> 00:06:12.155
Ben laughed, and to his delight, so did Winnie.

83
00:06:12.156 --> 00:06:23.146
"Come on," she said. "Let's go talk to her."
